# BharatCMS Landing Page

## Tech Stack
- Next.js 14 (App Router) + TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS + shadcn/ui
- Framer Motion (animations)
- Clerk (auth)
- Zustand (state)
- React Query (data)

## Design System
- Style: Glassmorphism + Dark Mode
- Primary: #00d4ff (cyan)
- Secondary: #a855f7 (purple)
- Indian: #FF9933 (saffron) - sparingly
- Background: #0f0f12
- Glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.08) + backdrop-blur 16px
- Border-radius: 16px (cards), 12px (buttons)
- Font: Inter (headings + body), JetBrains Mono (code)

## Component Patterns
- Use shadcn/ui as base
- Glass effect on all cards
- Neobrutalist shadow on primary buttons
- Framer Motion for entrance animations
- Mobile-first responsive design

## Folder Structure
- src/app/(marketing) - Public pages
- src/app/(auth) - Login/signup
- src/app/(dashboard) - User dashboard
- src/components/ui - shadcn primitives
- src/components/marketing - Landing components
- src/components/dashboard - Dashboard components

## DON'T
- Don't use stock photos (use real Indian context)
- Don't use rainbow colors (stick to palette)
- Don't aggressive shadows (subtle only)
- Don't crowded layouts (use whitespace)

## DO
- Use ₹ symbol (not $)
- Indian number format (1,00,000)
- Hindi/English language toggle
- Mobile-first design
- Skeleton loaders (not spinners)

## Current Phase
Phase: 1 (Build landing page)
